{"unit_id":"henrytunwang__dsh-plugin-session-fulltext#card-zh","repo":"henrytunwang/dsh-plugin-session-fulltext","commit":"922f09a142452002ceec58dcd03fed77c099b40e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-fulltext 是面向 DSH Web 侧边栏的会话内容搜索插件。它替换 Session Query 服务的搜索方法，以大小写不敏感的字面子串扫描当前会话中的用户和助手消息，并为命中会话生成摘要。浏览器端会在点击结果后定位消息、滚动加载较早历史、标亮匹配内容，并提供会话内上一个和下一个匹配项导航。它适合需要从历史对话中查找中文短词、英文或代码片段的 DSH 用户。首次启动后会在内存中预热搜索缓存；无需额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:53-68","index.js:142-201","lib/client.js:166-214"]}
{"unit_id":"henrytunwang__dsh-plugin-session-fulltext#card-en","repo":"henrytunwang/dsh-plugin-session-fulltext","commit":"922f09a142452002ceec58dcd03fed77c099b40e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-session-fulltext adds content search to the DSH sidebar. It finds literal, case-insensitive matches in user and assistant messages and returns snippets. Selecting a result opens and highlights the match, with controls to navigate other matches in that chat.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:53-68","index.js:142-201","lib/client.js:166-214"]}
